1,How do I reset my password?,how do i reset my password,how do i reset my password,reset password,reset password,password_reset,You can reset your password through the internal password reset portal at portal.company.com/reset. You will need your employee ID to verify your identity.,password,password
2,I forgot my company password.,i forgot my company password,i forgot my company password,forgot company password,forgot company password,password_reset,"Use the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page or visit the IT helpdesk in Building A, Room 101 during business hours.",password,password
3,Where can I change my password?,where can i change my password,where can i change my password,change password,change password,password_reset,You can change your password by going to Settings > Security > Change Password in the employee portal.,password,password
4,I cannot remember my login password.,i cannot remember my login password,i can not remember my login password,remember login password,remember login password,password_reset,Click 'Forgot Password' on the login screen and follow the instructions sent to your registered email.,password,"account,password"
5,How do I create a new password?,how do i create a new password,how do i create a new password,create new password,create new password,password_reset,"Log into the employee portal, navigate to Settings > Security, and select 'Change Password'. Your new password must be at least 8 characters with uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and special characters.",password,password
6,Where is the password reset option?,where is the password reset option,where is the password reset option,password reset option,password reset option,password_reset,The password reset option is available on the login page under the password field. You can also access it directly at portal.company.com/reset.,password,password
