95,What is the leave policy?,what is the leave policy,what is the leave policy,leave policy,leave policy,leave_policy,Employees are entitled to 20 days of paid annual leave per year. Leave must be approved by your manager at least 2 weeks in advance.,leave,leave
96,How do I apply for leave?,how do i apply for leave,how do i apply for leave,apply leave,apply leave,leave_policy,Submit a leave request through the HR portal at portal.company.com/leave. Your manager will be notified for approval.,leave,leave
97,How many sick days do I get?,how many sick days do i get,how many sick days do i get,many sick days get,many sick day get,leave_policy,Employees receive 10 paid sick days per year. A medical certificate is required for sick leave exceeding 3 consecutive days.,leave,leave
98,Can I carry over unused leave?,can i carry over unused leave,can i carry over unused leave,carry unused leave,carry unused leave,leave_policy,Up to 5 days of unused annual leave can be carried over to the next year. Excess leave will be forfeited.,leave,leave
99,How do I check my leave balance?,how do i check my leave balance,how do i check my leave balance,check leave balance,check leave balance,leave_policy,Log into the HR portal and go to My Account > Leave Balance to view your remaining leave days.,leave,leave
100,What is the notice period for leave?,what is the notice period for leave,what is the notice period for leave,notice period leave,notice period leave,leave_policy,Annual leave requires 2 weeks notice. Sick leave should be reported as soon as possible. Emergency leave requires manager approval.,leave,leave
101,Can I take unpaid leave?,can i take unpaid leave,can i take unpaid leave,take unpaid leave,take unpaid leave,leave_policy,Unpaid leave is possible with manager and HR approval. Submit a request through the HR portal with justification.,leave,leave
102,How do I cancel a leave request?,how do i cancel a leave request,how do i cancel a leave request,cancel leave request,cancel leave request,leave_policy,"Go to the HR portal, find your pending leave request, and click Cancel. Your manager will be notified.",leave,leave
