104,What is paternity leave policy?,what is paternity leave policy,what is paternity leave policy,paternity leave policy,paternity leave policy,leave_policy,Eligible employees receive 2 weeks of paid paternity leave. Contact HR at extension 5678 for details.,leave,leave
105,How do I apply for bereavement leave?,how do i apply for bereavement leave,how do i apply for bereavement leave,apply bereavement leave,apply bereavement leave,leave_policy,Contact HR at extension 5678 immediately. Bereavement leave is granted for immediate family members.,leave,leave
106,Can I take leave during probation?,can i take leave during probation,can i take leave during probation,take leave probation,take leave probation,leave_policy,Leave during probation is subject to manager approval. Annual leave accrues from your start date.,leave,leave
107,How do I check my attendance?,how do i check my attendance,how do i check my attendance,check attendance,check attendance,attendance,Log into the HR portal and go to My Account > Attendance to view your attendance records.,attendance,attendance
108,What are the working hours?,what are the working hours,what are the working hours,working hours,working hour,working_hours,"Standard working hours are 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Monday to Friday. Flexible working arrangements require manager approval.",working_hours,working_hours
