117,What is the contact number for IT support?,what is the contact number for it support,what is the contact number for it support,contact number support,contact number support,contact_information,"IT support can be reached at extension 1234 or email it-support@company.com. The IT helpdesk is in Building A, Room 101.",contact,"contact,it_support"
118,How do I report a security incident?,how do i report a security incident,how do i report a security incident,report security incident,report security incident,security,Immediately report security incidents to IT security at extension 9999 or email security@company.com. Do not share sensitive information.,security,security
119,How do I request technical support?,how do i request technical support,how do i request technical support,request technical support,request technical support,technical_support,Submit a support ticket through the IT portal or call IT support at extension 1234. Provide detailed information about your issue.,it_support,it_support
