122,Good morning,good morning,good morning,good morning,good morning,greetings,"Good morning! How can I assist you today? Feel free to ask about password resets, software installation, leave policies, and more.",greeting,greeting
123,Good afternoon,good afternoon,good afternoon,good afternoon,good afternoon,greetings,"Good afternoon! How can I help you? I can provide information on IT support, HR policies, and company procedures.",greeting,greeting
124,Good evening,good evening,good evening,good evening,good evening,greetings,"Good evening! How can I assist you? I can help with IT issues, HR questions, and general company information.",greeting,greeting
