132,See you later,see you later,see you later,see later,see later,goodbye,"See you later! If you need further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out. Have a great day!",goodbye,goodbye
133,"Thank you, bye",thank you bye,thank you bye,thank bye,thank bye,goodbye,"You're welcome! Goodbye! If you have more questions, I'm here to help.",goodbye,goodbye
134,"Thanks, goodbye",thanks goodbye,thanks goodbye,thanks goodbye,thanks goodbye,goodbye,You're welcome! Goodbye! Have a productive day ahead.,goodbye,goodbye
135,Take care,take care,take care,take care,take care,goodbye,"Take care! If you need any help in the future, I'm here for you. Goodbye!",goodbye,goodbye
