139,"Thanks, that's all",thanks that's all,thanks that is all,thanks,thanks,goodbye,"You're welcome! Goodbye! If you have more questions, don't hesitate to ask.",goodbye,
140,Can you help me?,can you help me,can you help me,help,help,help,"Of course! I can help you with various topics including password resets, IT support, HR policies, leave applications, software installation, and more. What do you need help with?",help,help
141,I need assistance,i need assistance,i need assistance,need assistance,need assistance,help,"I'm here to help! You can ask me about password resets, account access, IT support, HR policies, leave, attendance, and more.",help,help
142,Help me please,help me please,help me please,help please,help please,help,"I'd be happy to help! Tell me what you need assistance with. I can help with IT issues, HR questions, and company policies.",help,help
143,I have a question,i have a question,i have a question,question,question,help,"Sure! Ask me anything about password resets, IT support, HR policies, leave, attendance, or other company topics.",help,
144,Can you assist me?,can you assist me,can you assist me,assist,assist,help,"Absolutely! I can assist with password resets, account issues, IT support, HR questions, software installation, and more. What do you need?",help,help
145,I need some help,i need some help,i need some help,need help,need help,help,"I'm here to help! What do you need assistance with? I can help with IT issues, HR questions, and company policies.",help,help
146,What can you help me with?,what can you help me with,what can you help me with,help,help,help,"I can help with password resets, account access, IT support, HR policies, leave applications, attendance, software installation, and more.",help,help
147,I need support,i need support,i need support,need support,need support,help,"I'm here to support you! Ask me about password resets, IT issues, HR policies, or any other company-related questions.",help,
148,Can you answer my questions?,can you answer my questions,can you answer my questions,answer questions,answer question,help,"Yes, I can answer questions about password resets, IT support, HR policies, leave, attendance, and other company topics.",help,
149,I need guidance,i need guidance,i need guidance,need guidance,need guidance,help,"I'm here to provide guidance! Ask me about password resets, account access, IT support, HR policies, and more.",help,
150,What should I do if I have a problem?,what should i do if i have a problem,what should i do if i have a problem,problem,problem,help,"If you have a problem, describe it to me and I'll help you find the right solution. I can assist with IT issues, HR questions, and company policies.",help,
151,I don't know what to do,i don't know what to do,i do not know what to do,know,know,help,"Don't worry! Tell me what you're trying to accomplish, and I'll guide you through the process. I can help with IT, HR, and other topics.",help,
152,Who can help me?,who can help me,who can help me,help,help,help,"I can help you! For complex issues, I can also direct you to the right department: IT support at extension 1234, HR at extension 5678, or IT security at extension 9999.",help,help
153,I need information,i need information,i need information,need information,need information,help,"I'm here to provide information! Ask me about password resets, leave policies, IT support, HR questions, and more.",help,
154,Can you guide me?,can you guide me,can you guide me,guide,guide,help,"Yes, I can guide you! Tell me what you need help with, and I'll provide step-by-step assistance.",help,
155,I'm lost,i'm lost,i am lost,lost,lose,help,"I'm here to help! Tell me what you're looking for. I can assist with IT issues, HR questions, and company policies.",help,
156,What are my options?,what are my options,what are my options,options,option,help,"You can ask me about password resets, account access, IT support, HR policies, leave, attendance, software installation, and more.",help,
157,I need directions,i need directions,i need directions,need directions,need direction,help,"I can help guide you! For physical office locations, the main office is at 123 Business Park. For process guidance, ask me about specific topics.",help,
158,Can you tell me more?,can you tell me more,can you tell me more,tell,tell,help,"I'd be happy to provide more information! Ask me about any specific topic like password resets, IT support, HR policies, or leave.",help,
159,I need to speak to someone,i need to speak to someone,i need to speak to someone,need speak someone,need speak someone,help,"For immediate assistance, contact IT support at extension 1234, HR at extension 5678, or IT security at extension 9999. I can also help with common questions.",help,
160,How do I mark my attendance each day?,how do i mark my attendance each day,how do i mark my attendance each day,mark attendance day,mark attendance day,attendance,Use the biometric scanner or the HR mobile app to clock in and out. Your attendance is recorded automatically.,attendance,attendance
161,Can I view my attendance on the mobile app?,can i view my attendance on the mobile app,can i view my attendance on the mobile app,view attendance mobile app,view attendance mobile app,attendance,"Yes, download the HR mobile app and go to the Attendance tab. You can view daily, weekly, and monthly records.",attendance,"software,attendance"
162,What should I do if the attendance system is down?,what should i do if the attendance system is down,what should i do if the attendance system is down,attendance system,attendance system,attendance,Note your clock-in and clock-out times in a manual register and submit it to HR. The system will sync once it is back up.,attendance,attendance
163,How do I correct an incorrect attendance entry?,how do i correct an incorrect attendance entry,how do i correct an incorrect attendance entry,correct incorrect attendance entry,correct incorrect attendance entry,attendance,Submit a correction request through the HR portal within 24 hours. Your manager must approve the change.,attendance,attendance
164,Is there a grace period for clocking in?,is there a grace period for clocking in,is there a grace period for clocking in,grace period clocking,grace period clock,attendance,A 10-minute grace period is allowed for clocking in each morning. Repeated late entries beyond the grace period will be flagged.,attendance,
165,How do I check my overtime hours?,how do i check my overtime hours,how do i check my overtime hours,check overtime hours,check overtime hour,attendance,Overtime hours appear in the Attendance section of the HR portal. They are calculated based on your scheduled daily hours.,attendance,
166,Can my manager view my attendance records?,can my manager view my attendance records,can my manager view my attendance records,manager view attendance records,manager view attendance record,attendance,"Yes, managers can view team attendance in the HR portal under Reports > Attendance. They can also approve or reject correction requests.",attendance,attendance
167,What happens if I forget to clock out?,what happens if i forget to clock out,what happens if i forget to clock out,happens forget clock,happens forget clock,attendance,"If you forget to clock out, contact HR at extension 5678 within the same day. The system will use your scheduled shift end time.",attendance,
168,How do I generate an attendance report?,how do i generate an attendance report,how do i generate an attendance report,generate attendance report,generate attendance report,attendance,Go to HR Portal > Attendance > Reports. Select the date range and download the report as PDF or Excel.,attendance,attendance
169,Do part-time employees have different attendance rules?,do part-time employees have different attendance rules,do employees have different attendance rules,employees different attendance rules,employee different attendance rule,attendance,Part-time employees follow a separate schedule set by their manager. Attendance is still tracked through the HR portal and mobile app.,attendance,attendance
170,How do I set up attendance notifications?,how do i set up attendance notifications,how do i set up attendance notifications,set attendance notifications,set attendance notification,attendance,Enable notifications in the HR mobile app under Settings > Attendance. You will receive daily reminders to clock in and out.,attendance,attendance
171,What is the IT helpdesk email address?,what is the it helpdesk email address,what is the it helpdesk email address,helpdesk email address,helpdesk email address,contact_information,"Email IT support at it-support@company.com for non-urgent issues. For immediate assistance, call extension 1234.",contact,"email,it_support"
172,Where can I find the company directory?,where can i find the company directory,where can i find the company directory,find company directory,find company directory,contact_information,"The company directory is on the company intranet under the Directory section. Search by name, department, or role to find contact details.",contact,contact
173,What is the general company contact number?,what is the general company contact number,what is the general company contact number,general company contact number,general company contact number,contact_information,Call the main reception in the Building A lobby. Reception is available from 8 AM to 8 PM on weekdays.,contact,contact
174,How do I contact the security desk?,how do i contact the security desk,how do i contact the security desk,contact security desk,contact security desk,contact_information,Reach the security desk at extension 9999 or security@company.com. The desk is in the main lobby of Building A.,contact,"security,contact"
175,How do I find a specific colleague's contact details?,how do i find a specific colleague's contact details,how do i find a specific colleague s contact details,find specific colleague contact details,find specific colleague contact detail,contact_information,Use the company directory on the company intranet. Search by name or employee ID to find their email and extension.,contact,contact
176,How can I contact HR for general inquiries?,how can i contact hr for general inquiries,how can i contact hr for general inquiries,contact hr general inquiries,contact hr general inquiry,contact_information,"Contact HR at extension 5678 or hr@company.com. The HR office is in Building B, Room 201.",contact,"hr,contact"
177,What is the best way to report an IT issue?,what is the best way to report an it issue,what is the best way to report an it issue,best way report issue,best way report issue,contact_information,Submit a ticket through the IT portal or call IT support at extension 1234. Email it-support@company.com for non-urgent issues.,contact,
178,Can I message my manager through the company platform?,can i message my manager through the company platform,can i message my manager through the company platform,message manager company platform,message manager company platform,contact_information,"Yes, use the company communication platform to message your manager. Their profile is also listed in the company directory on the intranet.",contact,
179,Who should I contact for payroll questions?,who should i contact for payroll questions,who should i contact for payroll questions,contact payroll questions,contact payroll question,contact_information,Direct payroll inquiries to HR at extension 5678 or hr@company.com. They will route your request to the payroll team.,contact,"payroll,contact"
180,What are the emergency contact numbers?,what are the emergency contact numbers,what are the emergency contact numbers,emergency contact numbers,emergency contact number,contact_information,"For emergencies, contact security at extension 9999. For medical emergencies, call 911. HR is at extension 5678 for urgent matters.",contact,contact
181,How do I contact IT security?,how do i contact it security,how do i contact it security,contact security,contact security,contact_information,Contact IT security at extension 9999 or security@company.com for any security-related concerns.,contact,"security,contact"
182,Where can I find my employee ID on my payslip?,where can i find my employee id on my payslip,where can i find my employee id on my payslip,find employee id payslip,find employee id payslip,employee_id,Your employee ID appears at the top right corner of your payslip in the HR portal. It starts with 'EMP-' followed by 5 digits.,employee_id,"payroll,employee_id"
183,I lost my employee ID card. What should I do?,i lost my employee id card what should i do,i lost my employee id card what should i do,lost employee id card,lose employee id card,employee_id,Report the lost card to HR at extension 5678 immediately. A replacement card costs $10 and is ready in 3 business days.,employee_id,employee_id
184,How do I request a replacement employee ID card?,how do i request a replacement employee id card,how do i request a replacement employee id card,request replacement employee id card,request replacement employee id card,employee_id,"Submit a request through the HR portal under My Account > ID Card. Pick up your card from the HR office in Building B, Room 201.",employee_id,employee_id
185,What if I forget my employee ID number?,what if i forget my employee id number,what if i forget my employee id number,forget employee id number,forget employee id number,employee_id,Your employee ID is listed in the HR portal under My Profile. You can also find it on your offer letter and pay stubs.,employee_id,employee_id
186,How do I activate my employee ID card for building access?,how do i activate my employee id card for building access,how do i activate my employee id card for building access,activate employee id card building access,activate employee id card building access,employee_id,Visit the security desk in the Building A lobby with your ID card and employee ID number. Security will activate your card for building access.,employee_id,"employee_id,location"
187,Can I use my employee ID for cafeteria payments?,can i use my employee id for cafeteria payments,can i use my employee id for cafeteria payments,use employee id cafeteria payments,use employee id cafeteria payment,employee_id,"Yes, link your employee ID to your cafeteria account through the HR portal under My Account > Cafeteria. Payroll deduction is set up automatically.",employee_id,"employee_id,location"
188,What is the format of my employee ID?,what is the format of my employee id,what is the format of my employee id,format employee id,format employee id,employee_id,Your employee ID follows the format EMP-XXXXX where X is a digit. It is unique to you and never changes.,employee_id,employee_id
189,How do I update a name change on my employee ID?,how do i update a name change on my employee id,how do i update a name change on my employee id,update name change employee id,update name change employee id,employee_id,Submit a name change request through the HR portal with supporting documents. HR will issue a new employee ID card.,employee_id,employee_id
190,Where do I collect my employee ID card?,where do i collect my employee id card,where do i collect my employee id card,collect employee id card,collect employee id card,employee_id,"Collect your employee ID card from the HR office in Building B, Room 201. Bring a government-issued photo ID for verification.",employee_id,employee_id
191,Can a temporary contractor get an employee ID?,can a temporary contractor get an employee id,can a temporary contractor get an employee id,temporary contractor get employee id,temporary contractor get employee id,employee_id,Contractors receive a vendor ID card instead of an employee ID. Contact HR at extension 5678 for details.,employee_id,employee_id
192,How do I reset my employee ID account password?,how do i reset my employee id account password,how do i reset my employee id account password,reset employee id account password,reset employee id account password,employee_id,Employee ID account passwords are managed through the HR portal. Use the Forgot Password link under My Account.,employee_id,"account,password,employee_id"
193,How do I check the company holiday calendar?,how do i check the company holiday calendar,how do i check the company holiday calendar,check company holiday calendar,check company holiday calendar,holidays,The holiday calendar is on the company intranet under HR > Holidays. It is updated annually with all official company holidays.,holiday,holiday
194,Is Independence Day a company holiday?,is independence day a company holiday,is independence day a company holiday,independence day company holiday,independence day company holiday,holidays,"Yes, Independence Day is a company holiday. Check the intranet calendar under HR > Holidays for the exact date each year.",holiday,holiday
195,Are there any holidays in December?,are there any holidays in december,are there any holidays in december,holidays december,holiday december,holidays,Major December holidays include Christmas Day and New Year's Day. The full list is on the company intranet under HR > Holidays.,holiday,holiday
196,How many paid holidays does the company provide?,how many paid holidays does the company provide,how many paid holidays does the company provide,many paid holidays company provide,many pay holiday company provide,holidays,The company provides 10 paid holidays per year. The complete list is available on the company intranet under HR > Holidays.,holiday,holiday
197,Will salary be affected if payday falls on a holiday?,will salary be affected if payday falls on a holiday,will salary be affected if payday falls on a holiday,salary affected payday falls holiday,salary affect payday fall holiday,holidays,"Salary is paid on the last working day of the month. If payday falls on a weekend or holiday, salary is credited on the previous working day.",holiday,"salary,payroll,holiday"
198,Is New Year's Day a paid holiday?,is new year's day a paid holiday,is new year s day a paid holiday,new year day paid holiday,new year day pay holiday,holidays,"Yes, New Year's Day is a paid company holiday. It is listed on the company holiday calendar in the HR portal.",holiday,holiday
199,Are there any half-day holidays?,are there any half-day holidays,are there any holidays,holidays,holiday,holidays,No half-day holidays are observed. All holidays are full days off. Check the calendar on the company intranet for the full list.,holiday,holiday
200,Can I work on a company holiday for extra pay?,can i work on a company holiday for extra pay,can i work on a company holiday for extra pay,work company holiday extra pay,work company holiday extra pay,holidays,Working on a company holiday is discouraged and requires prior manager approval. Holiday work is compensated at 1.5x the regular rate.,holiday,holiday
201,How do I find the list of upcoming holidays?,how do i find the list of upcoming holidays,how do i find the list of upcoming holidays,find list upcoming holidays,find list upcoming holiday,holidays,Access the company holiday list on the company intranet under HR > Holidays. The calendar shows all upcoming holidays for the current year.,holiday,holiday
202,Do I get paid if I work during a holiday?,do i get paid if i work during a holiday,do i get paid if i work during a holiday,get paid work holiday,get pay work holiday,holidays,"If you work on a company holiday with prior approval, you receive holiday pay plus 1.5x your regular hourly rate for the hours worked.",holiday,holiday
203,Is Labor Day a paid company holiday?,is labor day a paid company holiday,is labor day a paid company holiday,labor day paid company holiday,labor day pay company holiday,holidays,"Yes, Labor Day is a paid company holiday. It is listed on the company holiday calendar under HR > Holidays on the company intranet.",holiday,holiday
204,How do I submit an HR case?,how do i submit an hr case,how do i submit an hr case,submit hr case,submit hr case,hr_support,Submit an HR case through the HR portal under Support > New Case. Select the category and provide details for a prompt response.,hr,hr
205,What are HR office hours?,what are hr office hours,what are hr office hours,hr office hours,hr office hour,hr_support,"HR office hours are 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Monday to Friday. The office is in Building B, Room 201.",hr,"working_hours,hr"
206,How do I schedule an appointment with HR?,how do i schedule an appointment with hr,how do i schedule an appointment with hr,schedule appointment hr,schedule appointment hr,hr_support,Book an appointment through the HR portal under Support > Schedule Meeting. Walk-ins are also accepted during office hours.,hr,hr
207,Can I request an employment verification letter?,can i request an employment verification letter,can i request an employment verification letter,request employment verification letter,request employment verification letter,hr_support,Request an employment verification letter through the HR portal under Services > Documents. It is issued within 2 business days.,hr,
208,How do I update my personal information in HR records?,how do i update my personal information in hr records,how do i update my personal information in hr records,update personal information hr records,update personal information hr record,hr_support,Update your personal information through the HR portal under My Account > Profile. Some changes require supporting documents.,hr,hr
209,How do I report a workplace concern to HR?,how do i report a workplace concern to hr,how do i report a workplace concern to hr,report workplace concern hr,report workplace concern hr,hr_support,Report workplace concerns through the HR portal under Support > Report Issue or call extension 5678. All reports are confidential.,hr,hr
210,Can HR help with career counseling?,can hr help with career counseling,can hr help with career counseling,hr help career counseling,hr help career counseling,hr_support,"Yes, HR offers career counseling sessions. Book through the HR portal under Development > Career Counseling. Sessions are free and confidential.",hr,"hr,help"
211,How do I request a reference letter from HR?,how do i request a reference letter from hr,how do i request a reference letter from hr,request reference letter hr,request reference letter hr,hr_support,Submit a request through the HR portal under Services > Documents > Reference Letter. It is issued within 2 business days.,hr,hr
212,What benefits does HR manage?,what benefits does hr manage,what benefits does hr manage,benefits hr manage,benefit hr manage,hr_support,"HR manages health insurance, retirement plans, employee discounts, and wellness programs. Visit the HR portal under Benefits for full details.",hr,hr
213,How do I file a formal complaint with HR?,how do i file a formal complaint with hr,how do i file a formal complaint with hr,file formal complaint hr,file formal complaint hr,hr_support,File a formal complaint through the HR portal under Support > Report Issue. All complaints are investigated confidentially.,hr,hr
214,How do I enroll in company benefits?,how do i enroll in company benefits,how do i enroll in company benefits,enroll company benefits,enroll company benefit,hr_support,"Benefits enrollment is done during onboarding. For changes, use the HR portal under Benefits > Enroll. Deadlines follow the annual open enrollment period.",hr,
215,My internet connection is very slow today.,my internet connection is very slow today,my internet connection is very slow today,internet connection slow today,internet connection slow today,internet_problems,"Check if other devices are affected. Try restarting your router. If the issue persists, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,internet
216,The internet is completely down in my office.,the internet is completely down in my office,the internet is completely down in my office,internet completely office,internet completely office,internet_problems,"Check with colleagues to confirm the outage. Try restarting your router. If the outage is widespread, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,internet
217,How do I reset my network settings?,how do i reset my network settings,how do i reset my network settings,reset network settings,reset network setting,internet_problems,"Go to Control Panel > Network and Sharing Center > Change adapter settings. Right-click your connection and select Repair. If issues remain, call extension 1234.",internet,internet
218,My ethernet cable is not working.,my ethernet cable is not working,my ethernet cable is not working,ethernet cable working,ethernet cable work,internet_problems,"Check that the cable is firmly connected at both ends. Try a different port on the network switch. If it still fails, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,
219,Why can I not access certain websites?,why can i not access certain websites,why can i not access certain websites,access certain websites,access certain website,internet_problems,"Some sites may be blocked by company security policy. If you need access for work, submit a request to IT support at extension 1234.",internet,
220,The WiFi works on my phone but not on my laptop.,the wifi works on my phone but not on my laptop,the wifi works on my phone but not on my laptop,wifi works phone laptop,wifi work phone laptop,internet_problems,"Check your laptop's WiFi settings. Ensure you are connected to the correct SSID. Restart your laptop and try again, or call extension 1234.",internet,"laptop,wifi,contact"
221,My browser shows a DNS server not found error.,my browser shows a dns server not found error,my browser shows a dns server not found error,browser shows dns server found error,browser show dns server find error,internet_problems,"Try flushing your DNS cache by running 'ipconfig /flushdns' in Command Prompt. If the error persists, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,
222,The network keeps disconnecting every few minutes.,the network keeps disconnecting every few minutes,the network keeps disconnecting every few minutes,network keeps disconnecting every minutes,network keep disconnect every minute,internet_problems,"Move closer to the WiFi router. Check if the issue is with a specific device. If it continues, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,internet
223,Can I get a wired ethernet connection?,can i get a wired ethernet connection,can i get a wired ethernet connection,get wired ethernet connection,get wired ethernet connection,internet_problems,"Ethernet cables are available from the IT helpdesk in Building A, Room 101. Contact IT support at extension 1234 to request one.",internet,
224,My VPN connection drops after 30 minutes.,my vpn connection drops after 30 minutes,my vpn connection drops after 30 minutes,vpn connection drops 30 minutes,vpn connection drop 30 minute,internet_problems,"VPN sessions time out after 30 minutes of inactivity. Reconnect through the VPN portal at portal.company.com. If issues persist, call extension 1234.",internet,
225,How do I test my internet speed?,how do i test my internet speed,how do i test my internet speed,test internet speed,test internet speed,internet_problems,"Run the network diagnostics tool from the IT portal. For consistently slow speeds, contact IT support at extension 1234.",internet,internet
226,Where is the nearest coffee station?,where is the nearest coffee station,where is the nearest coffee station,nearest coffee station,near coffee station,office_location,"Coffee stations are in the break rooms on every floor. The main one is in the kitchen area near Building A, Room 105.",location,location
227,Where is the main cafeteria?,where is the main cafeteria,where is the main cafeteria,main cafeteria,main cafeteria,office_location,The main cafeteria is on the ground floor of Building A. It is open from 8 AM to 4 PM on weekdays.,location,location
228,How do I get to Building B?,how do i get to building b,how do i get to building b,get building b,get building b,office_location,Building B is across the courtyard from Building A. Walk through the main lobby and follow signs to Building B. It houses HR and Finance.,location,location
229,Where is the nearest restroom?,where is the nearest restroom,where is the nearest restroom,nearest restroom,near restroom,office_location,Restrooms are located on every floor near the elevators. Gender-neutral restrooms are available on each floor as well.,location,
230,Where can I find a quiet workspace?,where can i find a quiet workspace,where can i find a quiet workspace,find quiet workspace,find quiet workspace,office_location,Quiet workspaces are in the library zone on the 3rd floor of Building A. These areas enforce no phone calls or meetings.,location,
231,Where is the nearest emergency exit?,where is the nearest emergency exit,where is the nearest emergency exit,nearest emergency exit,near emergency exit,office_location,Emergency exits are marked with green signs. The nearest exit from most desks is at the end of the hallway near the stairwell.,location,
232,Where is the first aid station?,where is the first aid station,where is the first aid station,first aid station,first aid station,office_location,First aid stations are in the main lobbies of Building A and Building B. Trained first aiders are available on each floor.,location,
233,Where can I find bookable meeting rooms?,where can i find bookable meeting rooms,where can i find bookable meeting rooms,find bookable meeting rooms,find bookable meeting room,office_location,Bookable meeting rooms are listed on the company intranet under Facilities > Meeting Rooms. Conference Room A seats 10 people.,location,
234,How do I find a specific conference room?,how do i find a specific conference room,how do i find a specific conference room,find specific conference room,find specific conference room,office_location,Conference rooms are numbered and labeled on each floor. The room directory is on the company intranet under Facilities > Meeting Rooms.,location,
235,Where is the employee parking lot?,where is the employee parking lot,where is the employee parking lot,employee parking lot,employee parking lot,office_location,Employee parking is in the lot behind Building A. Display your parking permit on the dashboard. Visitor parking is in the front lot.,location,
236,Where is the fire assembly point?,where is the fire assembly point,where is the fire assembly point,fire assembly point,fire assembly point,office_location,The fire assembly point is in the courtyard between Building A and Building B. Proceed there immediately during a fire alarm or drill.,location,
237,What documents are needed for salary processing?,what documents are needed for salary processing,what documents are needed for salary processing,documents needed salary processing,document need salary processing,payroll,"Submit your bank details, PAN card, and PF UAN through the HR portal under My Account > Bank Details. Incomplete forms delay salary processing.",payroll,salary
238,Who do I contact about a salary discrepancy?,who do i contact about a salary discrepancy,who do i contact about a salary discrepancy,contact salary discrepancy,contact salary discrepancy,payroll,Contact the payroll team through HR at extension 5678 or hr@company.com. Provide your employee ID and the payslip with the discrepancy.,payroll,"salary,contact"
239,How do I update my bank account for salary credit?,how do i update my bank account for salary credit,how do i update my bank account for salary credit,update bank account salary credit,update bank account salary credit,payroll,Submit a bank detail update form through the HR portal under My Account > Bank Details. Changes take effect from the next pay cycle.,payroll,"account,salary"
240,What is the salary payment date each month?,what is the salary payment date each month,what is the salary payment date each month,salary payment date month,salary payment date month,payroll,"Salary is credited on the last working day of each month. If the date falls on a weekend or holiday, salary is processed on the previous working day.",payroll,salary
241,How do I request a salary advance?,how do i request a salary advance,how do i request a salary advance,request salary advance,request salary advance,payroll,Submit a salary advance request through the HR portal under Services > Payments. Approval requires manager and HR sign-off.,payroll,salary
242,What deductions appear on my payslip?,what deductions appear on my payslip,what deductions appear on my payslip,deductions appear payslip,deduction appear payslip,payroll,"Common deductions include income tax, PF, medical insurance, and professional tax. The detailed breakdown is in your payslip PDF.",payroll,payroll
243,Can I have my salary paid to a different bank account?,can i have my salary paid to a different bank account,can i have my salary paid to a different bank account,salary paid different bank account,salary pay different bank account,payroll,"Yes, update your bank details in the HR portal under My Account > Bank Details. You may need to submit a voided cheque as proof.",payroll,"account,salary"
244,How do I request an income certificate?,how do i request an income certificate,how do i request an income certificate,request income certificate,request income certificate,payroll,Request an income certificate through the HR portal under Services > Documents. It is issued within 2 business days.,payroll,
245,What is the salary reimbursement procedure?,what is the salary reimbursement procedure,what is the salary reimbursement procedure,salary reimbursement procedure,salary reimbursement procedure,payroll,Submit expense reports with receipts through the HR portal under Services > Reimbursements. Reimbursements are processed with your next salary.,payroll,salary
246,How do I check my salary credit status?,how do i check my salary credit status,how do i check my salary credit status,check salary credit status,check salary credit status,payroll,Your salary credit status is shown in the HR portal under My Account > Payslips. The status updates to Credited once processed.,payroll,salary
247,Where can I view my salary structure?,where can i view my salary structure,where can i view my salary structure,view salary structure,view salary structure,salary_information,"Your salary structure is in the HR portal under My Account > Salary. It shows your basic pay, allowances, and deductions.",salary,salary
248,How is my monthly salary calculated?,how is my monthly salary calculated,how is my monthly salary calculated,monthly salary calculated,monthly salary calculate,salary_information,Your salary is calculated as basic pay plus allowances minus deductions. The detailed breakdown is in your payslip PDF.,salary,salary
249,Can I see the salary breakup online?,can i see the salary breakup online,can i see the salary breakup online,see salary breakup online,see salary breakup online,salary_information,"Yes, the complete salary breakup is available in the HR portal under My Account > Payslips. Download the PDF for full details.",salary,salary
250,What components make up my monthly salary?,what components make up my monthly salary,what components make up my monthly salary,components make monthly salary,component make monthly salary,salary_information,"Your salary includes basic pay, house rent allowance, conveyance, and bonuses minus tax and statutory deductions. See your payslip for details.",salary,salary
251,How do I download my salary statement?,how do i download my salary statement,how do i download my salary statement,download salary statement,download salary statement,salary_information,Download salary statements from the HR portal under My Account > Payslips. Statements are available for the past 24 months.,salary,salary
252,Why is my salary lower than expected?,why is my salary lower than expected,why is my salary lower than expected,salary lower expected,salary low expect,salary_information,Check if there are new deductions or tax changes. Contact payroll through HR at extension 5678 with your employee ID for clarification.,salary,salary
253,How do I view my past salary details?,how do i view my past salary details,how do i view my past salary details,view past salary details,view past salary detail,salary_information,Access past salary details in the HR portal under My Account > Payslips. Select the month and year to view the payslip PDF.,salary,salary
254,What is the salary revision policy?,what is the salary revision policy,what is the salary revision policy,salary revision policy,salary revision policy,salary_information,Salary revisions are reviewed annually based on performance and market benchmarks. Discussions happen during the appraisal cycle.,salary,salary
255,How do I request a salary certificate?,how do i request a salary certificate,how do i request a salary certificate,request salary certificate,request salary certificate,salary_information,Request a salary certificate through the HR portal under Services > Documents. It is issued within 2 business days.,salary,salary
256,How do I know if my salary has been credited?,how do i know if my salary has been credited,how do i know if my salary has been credited,know salary credited,know salary credit,salary_information,Salary credit status appears in the HR portal under My Account > Payslips. You will also receive an email notification when salary is credited.,salary,salary
257,How do I report a lost ID badge?,how do i report a lost id badge,how do i report a lost id badge,report lost id badge,report lose id badge,security,Report a lost ID badge immediately to the security desk at extension 9999. A replacement costs $10 and is ready in 2 business days.,security,security
258,How do I get after-hours access to the building?,how do i get after-hours access to the building,how do i get access to the building,get access building,get access building,security,Submit an after-hours access request through the HR portal under Services > Access. Security approves and sends a one-time access code.,security,location
259,What should I do if I see suspicious activity?,what should i do if i see suspicious activity,what should i do if i see suspicious activity,see suspicious activity,see suspicious activity,security,Immediately notify security at extension 9999 or security@company.com. Do not approach the individual. Provide details of the suspicious activity.,security,security
260,How do I update my security questions for login?,how do i update my security questions for login,how do i update my security questions for login,update security questions login,update security question login,security,Go to Settings > Security > Security Questions in the employee portal. Update your questions and answers for account recovery.,security,"account,security"
261,What is the password change frequency policy?,what is the password change frequency policy,what is the password change frequency policy,password change frequency policy,password change frequency policy,security,Company policy requires password changes every 90 days. You will receive an email reminder 7 days before expiration.,security,password
262,What is multi-factor authentication?,what is multi-factor authentication,what is authentication,authentication,authentication,security,Multi-factor authentication adds a second layer of security to your account. Enable it in Settings > Security > Two-Factor Authentication in the employee portal.,security,
263,How do I secure my workstation when I leave?,how do i secure my workstation when i leave,how do i secure my workstation when i leave,secure workstation leave,secure workstation leave,security,Lock your computer with Ctrl+Alt+Delete or Windows+L. Report any unattended devices to security@company.com.,security,leave
264,What should I do if I clicked a phishing link?,what should i do if i clicked a phishing link,what should i do if i clicked a phishing link,clicked phishing link,click phishing link,security,Immediately change your password and report the incident to IT security at extension 9999. Do not enter any further sensitive information.,security,security
265,What is the procedure for a lost or stolen laptop?,what is the procedure for a lost or stolen laptop,what is the procedure for a lost or stolen laptop,procedure lost stolen laptop,procedure lose steal laptop,security,Report a lost or stolen laptop to IT security at extension 9999 within 2 hours. The device will be remotely wiped and the incident documented.,security,laptop
266,How do I encrypt sensitive files?,how do i encrypt sensitive files,how do i encrypt sensitive files,encrypt sensitive files,encrypt sensitive file,security,Use the built-in encryption tool in the employee portal under Services > Security > File Encryption. Contact IT security at extension 9999 for help.,security,
267,What is the company's physical security policy?,what is the company's physical security policy,what is the company s physical security policy,company physical security policy,company physical security policy,security,All visitors must sign in at the front desk and wear a visitor badge. Employees must escort visitors at all times. Report violations to security at extension 9999.,security,security
268,My laptop is running very slowly.,my laptop is running very slowly,my laptop is running very slowly,laptop running slowly,laptop running slowly,technical_support,"Close unnecessary applications and restart your laptop. If it is still slow, check for updates in the IT portal. Contact IT support at extension 1234.",it_support,laptop
269,How do I connect a second monitor to my laptop?,how do i connect a second monitor to my laptop,how do i connect a second monitor to my laptop,connect second monitor laptop,connect second monitor laptop,technical_support,Connect the HDMI or VGA cable to your laptop and monitor. Extend or duplicate the display in Display Settings. Call extension 1234 if issues persist.,it_support,laptop
270,My laptop battery is draining too quickly.,my laptop battery is draining too quickly,my laptop battery is draining too quickly,laptop battery draining quickly,laptop battery drain quickly,technical_support,"Check battery usage in Settings > System > Power. Reduce screen brightness and close background apps. If the battery is faulty, contact IT at extension 1234.",it_support,laptop
271,How do I back up my files automatically?,how do i back up my files automatically,how do i back up my files automatically,back files automatically,back file automatically,technical_support,"The company backup agent runs daily in the background. For manual backup, use the backup tool in the IT portal. Contact IT support at extension 1234 for setup help.",it_support,
272,My laptop screen is flickering intermittently.,my laptop screen is flickering intermittently,my laptop screen is flickering intermittently,laptop screen flickering intermittently,laptop screen flicker intermittently,technical_support,"Update your graphics drivers through the IT portal. Check that the display cable is secure. If it persists, contact IT support at extension 1234.",it_support,laptop
273,How do I run system diagnostics on my laptop?,how do i run system diagnostics on my laptop,how do i run system diagnostics on my laptop,run system diagnostics laptop,run system diagnostics laptop,technical_support,Run the built-in diagnostics tool from the IT portal under Tools > Diagnostics. Or access it through Settings > Update and Security > Troubleshoot.,it_support,laptop
274,My laptop overheats during heavy use.,my laptop overheats during heavy use,my laptop overheats during heavy use,laptop overheats heavy use,laptop overheats heavy use,technical_support,"Clean the air vents and ensure proper ventilation. Use a laptop stand. If overheating continues, contact IT support at extension 1234 for repair.",it_support,laptop
275,How do I reset my Outlook email profile?,how do i reset my outlook email profile,how do i reset my outlook email profile,reset outlook email profile,reset outlook email profile,technical_support,Go to Control Panel > Mail > Show Profiles. Create a new profile with your company email. Contact IT support at extension 1234 if needed.,it_support,email
276,My laptop will not power on.,my laptop will not power on,my laptop will not power on,laptop power,laptop power,technical_support,"Check the power cable and battery. Try a hard reset by holding the power button for 15 seconds. If it still will not start, contact IT support at extension 1234.",it_support,laptop
277,How do I free up disk space on my laptop?,how do i free up disk space on my laptop,how do i free up disk space on my laptop,free disk space laptop,free disk space laptop,technical_support,Run Disk Cleanup from the Start menu. Delete temporary files and empty the recycle bin. Contact IT support at extension 1234 for assistance.,it_support,laptop
278,How do I update my laptop drivers?,how do i update my laptop drivers,how do i update my laptop drivers,update laptop drivers,update laptop driver,technical_support,Download drivers from the company software portal at software.company.com or use Windows Update. Contact IT support at extension 1234 for help.,it_support,laptop
279,Can I work from home on Fridays?,can i work from home on fridays,can i work from home on fridays,work home fridays,work home friday,working_hours,Remote work on Fridays is allowed with manager approval. Submit a remote work request through the HR portal at least 2 days in advance.,working_hours,working_hours
280,What are the standard working hours?,what are the standard working hours,what are the standard working hours,standard working hours,standard working hour,working_hours,"Standard working hours are 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Monday to Friday. Lunch break is from 1 PM to 2 PM.",working_hours,working_hours
281,How do I request a shift change?,how do i request a shift change,how do i request a shift change,request shift change,request shift change,working_hours,Submit a shift change request through the HR portal under My Account > Schedule. Manager approval is required for all shift changes.,working_hours,working_hours
282,Can I work late and leave early on another day?,can i work late and leave early on another day,can i work late and leave early on another day,work late leave early another day,work late leave early another day,working_hours,Flexible scheduling is available with manager approval. Submit a time change request through the HR portal with justification.,working_hours,leave
283,What is the lunch break policy?,what is the lunch break policy,what is the lunch break policy,lunch break policy,lunch break policy,working_hours,The lunch break is from 1 PM to 2 PM daily. It is unpaid unless you are on a flexible schedule approved by your manager.,working_hours,
284,How many hours should I work per week?,how many hours should i work per week,how many hours should i work per week,many hours work per week,many hour work per week,working_hours,"The standard work week is 40 hours, Monday to Friday. Overtime beyond 45 hours requires prior manager approval.",working_hours,
285,Can I work on weekends?,can i work on weekends,can i work on weekends,work weekends,work weekend,working_hours,Weekend work requires prior approval from your manager and HR. Weekend hours are compensated at 1.5x the regular rate.,working_hours,
286,What is the overtime policy?,what is the overtime policy,what is the overtime policy,overtime policy,overtime policy,working_hours,Overtime is paid at 1.5x for hours beyond 45 per week. Submit overtime requests through the HR portal with manager approval.,working_hours,
287,How do I report my working hours for remote days?,how do i report my working hours for remote days,how do i report my working hours for remote days,report working hours remote days,report work hour remote day,working_hours,"Log your working hours in the HR portal under My Account > Attendance. Include your start, end, and break times for each day.",working_hours,working_hours
288,What is the half-day policy?,what is the half-day policy,what is the policy,policy,policy,working_hours,Half-day leave is allowed for personal matters. Apply at least 2 hours in advance through the HR portal under My Account > Leave.,working_hours,
289,How do I find out if the office is closed during a holiday?,how do i find out if the office is closed during a holiday,how do i find out if the office is closed during a holiday,find office closed holiday,find office close holiday,working_hours,"Check the company calendar on the intranet under HR > Holidays. If a holiday is declared, the office is closed and remote work is optional.",working_hours,holiday
290,How do I find the company WiFi network name?,how do i find the company wifi network name,how do i find the company wifi network name,find company wifi network name,find company wifi network name,wifi_problems,The company WiFi network name (SSID) is 'Company-Secure' for employees and 'Company-Guest' for visitors. Contact IT support at extension 1234 for passwords.,wifi,"wifi,internet"
291,Hey there,hey there,hey there,hey,hey,greetings,"Hello! How can I help you today? I can assist with IT issues, HR policies, and company questions.",greeting,greeting
292,"Hi, how are you?",hi how are you,hi how are you,hi,hi,greetings,"I'm doing well, thank you! How can I help you today with IT, HR, or any other company questions?",greeting,greeting
293,I'm done asking questions,i'm done asking questions,i am done asking questions,done asking questions,do ask question,goodbye,"Alright! If you need anything else, just ask. Have a great day ahead!",goodbye,
294,That's everything I needed,that's everything i needed,that is everything i needed,everything needed,everything need,goodbye,"You're welcome! If you have more questions later, don't hesitate to ask. Goodbye!",goodbye,
